      "Language": "hun",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Two cases of fibroelastosis of the coronary arteries in infants are reported. The fibroelastosis was complicated with coronary thrombosis. Histologically isolated proliferation of the intima, fibrosis of the media and disintegration of the lamina elastica interna was found."},
